Subject: AutoRAG Document Format Support Expansion - RHOAI 3.6
Date: Thu, 17 Jul 2026 10:00:00 +0000
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Dear RHOAI Users,

We are pleased to announce expanded document format support in AutoRAG for RHOAI 3.6.

In addition to the existing supported formats (PDF, DOCX, PPTX, Markdown, HTML, and plain text), AutoRAG now supports the following document formats:

- OpenDocument Text (.odt)
- OpenDocument Presentation (.odp)
- AsciiDoc (.adoc)
- LaTeX (.tex)
- EPUB (.epub)
- Email (.eml)
- Quarto Markdown (.qmd)
- R Markdown (.Rmd)
- XHTML (.xhtml)

These formats are supported end-to-end through the document discovery, text extraction, and indexing stages of the AutoRAG pipeline. All formats are converted to the DoclingDocument representation using the Docling library version 2.113.0.

For questions or feedback, please contact the RHOAI platform team.

Best regards,
The Red Hat OpenShift AI Team